# spec: real-world -- Keycloak OpenID token endpoint then an authenticated call.
# spec: drives the end-to-end chaining test (env file -> @var -> handler capture).
@realm = master

### login
POST {{authBase}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id={{clientId}}&username={{userName}}&password={{password}}

> {%
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.access_token);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refresh_token);
%}

### whoami
GET {{authBase}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
